{
    "title": "LEGO\u00ae DUPLO\u00ae PEPPA PIG",
    "description": "Jump into the world of LEGO\u00ae DUPLO\u00ae PEPPA PIG for happy and playful learning adventures. Enjoy fun galore with Peppa, her family and friends, muddy puddles, and more!\r\n\r\nLEGO DUPLO PEPPA PIG is a collection of oinktastic play experiences for little ones to enjoy. Each pack is set in a different location from the familiar world of Peppa Pig. We have brought Peppa and her friends and family to life in animated 3D LEGO DUPLO form to play with. Snort! \r\n\r\nThe app is packed full of fun, learning, and muddy puddles, guaranteeing lots of giggles and snorts! We regularly add new content to the app for an ever-expanding selection of play opportunities.\r\n\r\nWhen young children are having fun and playing, it creates the perfect conditions for them to learn and grow. So, we have specially designed fun and playful activities that fit your little one\u2019s developmental stage. Our goal is to help them develop a balance of the IQ skills (cognitive and creative) and EQ skills (social and emotional) they need for the best start in life.\r\n\r\nFEATURES  \r\n\r\n\u2022 Safe and age-appropriate  \r\n\r\n\u2022 Designed responsibly to let your child enjoy screen time while developing healthy digital habits at a young age  \r\n\r\n\u2022 FTC Approved COPPA Safe Harbor Certification by Privo. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Play pre-downloaded content offline without wifi or internet  \r\n\r\n\u2022 Regular updates with new content  \r\n\r\n\u2022 No third-party advertising  \r\n\r\n\u2022 No in-app purchases for subscribers\r\n\r\nSUPPORT  \r\n\r\nFor any questions or assistance, please reach out to us at support@storytoys.com.\r\n\r\nABOUT STORYTOYS \r\n\r\nOur mission is to bring the world's most popular characters, worlds, and stories to life for children. We make apps for kids that engage them in well-rounded activities designed to help them learn, play, and grow. Parents can enjoy peace of mind knowing their kids are learning and having fun at the same time.\r\n\r\nPRIVACY & TERMS\r\n\r\nStoryToys takes children\u2019s privacy seriously and ensures that its apps are compliant with privacy laws, including the Child Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA). If you would like to learn more on what information we collect and how we use it, please visit our privacy policy at https://storytoys.com/privacy\r\n\r\nRead our terms of use here: https://storytoys.com/terms/\r\n\r\nSUBSCRIPTION & IN-APP PURCHASE \r\n\r\nThis app contains sample content that is free to play. However, LOTS MORE fun and entertaining games and activities are available. You can buy individual units of content via in-app purchases. Alternatively, if you subscribe to the app you can play with EVERYTHING. We regularly add new stuff, so subscribed users will enjoy ever-expanding play opportunities. \r\n\r\nGoogle Play does not permit in-app purchases and free apps to be shared via Family Library, so any purchases you make in this app will not be shareable via Family Library.\r\n\r\nLEGO\u00ae, DUPLO\u00ae, the LEGO logo, and the DUPLO logo are trademarks and/or copyrights of the LEGO\u00ae Group. \u00a9 2024 The LEGO Group. All Rights Reserved.\r\n\r\nPEPPA PIG and all related trademarks and characters TM & \u00a9 2003 Astley Baker Davies Ltd and/or Entertainment One UK Limited. HASBRO and all related logos and trademarks TM & \u00a9 2024 Hasbro. All Rights Reserved. Used with Permission.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Jump into the world of LEGO\u00ae DUPLO\u00ae PEPPA PIG for happy and playful learning adventures. Enjoy fun galore with Peppa, her family and friends, muddy puddles, and more!<br><br>LEGO DUPLO PEPPA PIG is a collection of oinktastic play experiences for little ones to enjoy. Each pack is set in a different location from the familiar world of Peppa Pig. We have brought Peppa and her friends and family to life in animated 3D LEGO DUPLO form to play with. Snort! <br><br>The app is packed full of fun, learning, and muddy puddles, guaranteeing lots of giggles and snorts! We regularly add new content to the app for an ever-expanding selection of play opportunities.<br><br>When young children are having fun and playing, it creates the perfect conditions for them to learn and grow. So, we have specially designed fun and playful activities that fit your little one\u2019s developmental stage. Our goal is to help them develop a balance of the IQ skills (cognitive and creative) and EQ skills (social and emotional) they need for the best start in life.<br><br>FEATURES  <br><br>\u2022 Safe and age-appropriate  <br><br>\u2022 Designed responsibly to let your child enjoy screen time while developing healthy digital habits at a young age  <br><br>\u2022 FTC Approved COPPA Safe Harbor Certification by Privo. <br><br>\u2022 Play pre-downloaded content offline without wifi or internet  <br><br>\u2022 Regular updates with new content  <br><br>\u2022 No third-party advertising  <br><br>\u2022 No in-app purchases for subscribers<br><br>SUPPORT  <br><br>For any questions or assistance, please reach out to us at support@storytoys.com.<br><br>ABOUT STORYTOYS <br><br>Our mission is to bring the world&#39;s most popular characters, worlds, and stories to life for children. We make apps for kids that engage them in well-rounded activities designed to help them learn, play, and grow. Parents can enjoy peace of mind knowing their kids are learning and having fun at the same time.<br><br>PRIVACY &amp; TERMS<br><br>StoryToys takes children\u2019s privacy seriously and ensures that its apps are compliant with privacy laws, including the Child Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA). If you would like to learn more on what information we collect and how we use it, please visit our privacy policy at https://storytoys.com/privacy<br><br>Read our terms of use here: https://storytoys.com/terms/<br><br>SUBSCRIPTION &amp; IN-APP PURCHASE <br><br>This app contains sample content that is free to play. However, LOTS MORE fun and entertaining games and activities are available. You can buy individual units of content via in-app purchases. Alternatively, if you subscribe to the app you can play with EVERYTHING. We regularly add new stuff, so subscribed users will enjoy ever-expanding play opportunities. <br><br>Google Play does not permit in-app purchases and free apps to be shared via Family Library, so any purchases you make in this app will not be shareable via Family Library.<br><br>LEGO\u00ae, DUPLO\u00ae, the LEGO logo, and the DUPLO logo are trademarks and/or copyrights of the LEGO\u00ae Group. \u00a9 2024 The LEGO Group. All Rights Reserved.<br><br>PEPPA PIG and all related trademarks and characters TM &amp; \u00a9 2003 Astley Baker Davies Ltd and/or Entertainment One UK Limited. HASBRO and all related logos and trademarks TM &amp; \u00a9 2024 Hasbro. All Rights Reserved. Used with Permission.",
